"Research conversations and notes are saved locally. Send shares your question, bounded selected history, source excerpts from the files or Group you choose, and images you explicitly attach with the configured provider. It does not upload complete PDFs. Each request starts a new provider workflow; within that request, provider-stored responses or temporary memory replay may be used. Restoring local history never sends a request automatically. Deleting local history does not delete data retained by the provider under its own policy." : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"研究对话与笔记保存在本地。发送时，会将你的问题、限定长度的所选历史、所选文件或分组的来源摘录，以及你明确添加的图片交给已配置的供应商；不会上传完整 PDF。每次请求均启动新的供应商工作流；在单次请求内，可能使用供应商保存的响应或临时内存重放。恢复本地历史不会自动发送请求。删除本地历史不会删除供应商按其政策保留的数据。"}}}},
"Some changes could not be saved" : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"部分更改未能保存"}}}},
"Dogear will stay open to protect your changes. Retry saving or export your work before quitting." : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Dogear 将保持打开以保护你的更改。请重试保存或导出成果后再退出。"}}}},
